  "description": "Marten (PostgreSQL document store) implementation of the transactional outbox pattern for Excalibur. Composes Marten's IDocumentSession unit-of-work for reliable, at-least-once message delivery without hand-rolled SQL. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
